      "text": "CMI — Bank Service Initiation Requirements > Detail page\n\nSelecting a consent on the dashboard opens its detail page. The detail page presents the same information the customer saw at the time they gave consent — the limits, accounts, and conditions that defined what they agreed to. In addition to all fields shown on the dashboard card, the detail page must show a truncated Consent ID with a copy button (format: f47ac10b...d479\n).",
